Ideas re-implemented (no code copied)
- LiteLLM (MIT): reserve-at-maximum, reconcile, cancel budget reservation pattern.
- Aider (Apache-2.0): staged SEARCH/REPLACE edit matching.
- SWE-agent (MIT): batched masking of old tool output.
- Gemini CLI (Apache-2.0): tail-biased output truncation with spill, command-safety facts.
- Codex CLI (Apache-2.0): protected file names and git option denials (as facts).
- Roo Code (Apache-2.0) and OpenCode (MIT): hardened shadow-git configuration for undo.

Used, not modified or redistributed
- Bifrost by Maxim AI (Apache-2.0): AI gateway, run as a pinned v2.5.1 binary.
- Tavily API: web documentation search.
- mini-swe-agent (MIT): baseline agent for the benchmark only; never imported.

Benchmark datasets (downloaded at run time, not redistributed)
- Aider polyglot-benchmark (Exercism exercises, MIT).
- QuixBugs (MIT).

